# Hermetic assistant-worker test (in-process Rust fake CLI via support_fake_cli;
# replaced the retired external-script subprocess fake). Body is `network`-feature
# gated to match production `run_assistant_worker`; under buck the network feature
# is off so it compiles to an empty test crate, mirroring the network-gated
# direct-connect tests, and runs fully when the network feature is enabled.
rust_test(
    name = "intelligence-claude-agent-sdk-assistant-worker-fake-cli-test",
    srcs = glob(["tests/assistant_worker_fake_cli.rs", "tests/support_fake_cli.rs"]),
